* Special Elements lib
*
* Transformer
* ===========
* RU_U1200_U400_3000MVA_LF (1200KV to 400KV with 3GVA)
* RU_U750_U400_1200MVA_LF
* RU_U400_U120_300MVA_LF
* RU_U400_U20_400MVA_LF
* RU_U400_U230_600MVA_LF
* RU_U220_U110_120MVA_LF
* RU_U220_U110_200MVA_LF
* RU_U110_U10_40MVA_LF
* RU_U110_U20_40MVA_LF
* RU_U110_U10_200MVA_LF
* RU_U10_U0400_630KVA_LF
* RU_U20_U0400_630KVA_LF
* RU_U10_U0400_250KVA_LF
* RU_U10_U0400_100KVA_LF

*
* Lines
* =====
*
* All resistances are at 20degrees Celsius and DC resistances
* For other temp set:
* tact=actual temp.
* Cu: Rtact=R20*(234.5+(tact-20))/254.5
* Alu: Rtact=R20*(228+(tact-20))/248
* Skin effects not considered
* Skin effects Calculator: https://chemandy.com/calculators/round-wire-ac-resistance-calculator.htm
* Select the proper resistivity value for cu/alu wires (normally not pure?)





