.param gdi = { gai*(ue1r*ue1r+ue1i*ue1i)}
  gi1r   v1r   v10  Value = {v(v1r)*gar - v(v1i)*gai + v(v2r)*gbr - v(v2i)*gbi} tripdv={TRIPDV} tripdt={TRIPDT}; i1r
